Especially when you have to find one near an altar, which brings me to my
suggestion:

  (V) conVert alignment      5000 gp

This would allow you to convert your character to the priest(ess)'s alignment.
Of course, you would still face any particular wrath your god chooses to 
bestow.

How about:

  (H) Heal fully             250 gp
  (A) Restore Ability        450 gp

I think all the suggestions about shopkeepers and priests are pretty good.
They add some purpose to actually getting money (besides for points).  I found
in my more successful games that beyond points, I had very little use for
money.  (if you steal from the shops, there's little else to do with money, for
the most part). 

